#: lib/main_installer.py:1478
msgid "Choose between a modular live system and a regular Linux installation, then select a security profile."
msgstr "Pilih antara sistem live modular atau instalasi Linux biasa, lalu pilih profil keamanan."

#: lib/main_installer.py:1480
msgid "This image supports live installation only; you can still choose the security profile."
msgstr "Image ini hanya mendukung instalasi live; Anda tetap dapat memilih profil keamanan."

